{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RLSA-2026:102193","published":"2026-11-24T06:02:36.099725Z","modified":"2026-11-24T06:30:03.072930228Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-115506","CVE-2026-117610","CVE-2026-118370","CVE-2026-45186","CVE-2026-66046","CVE-2026-76641","CVE-2026-77214","CVE-2026-93990"],"summary":"Important: mingw-expat security update","details":"Expat is a C library for parsing XML documents. The mingw-expat packages provide a port of the Expat library for MinGW. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* libexpat: denial of service via crafted XML input (CVE-2026-45186)\n\n* expat: Expat: Denial of Service via quadratic complexity in attribute processing (CVE-2026-66046)\n\n* expat: Expat: Denial of Service via XML external entity parsing (CVE-2026-76641)\n\n* expat: Expat: XML Injection via Malformed UTF-16 Input (CVE-2026-93990)\n\n* expat: expat: Information disclosure via heap buffer over-read in XML_ParseBuffer (CVE-2026-77214)\n\n* expat: expat: Denial of Service via delayed entity amplification detection (CVE-2026-115506)\n\n* expat: expat: Denial of Service via NULL pointer dereference in external entity parsing (CVE-2026-117610)\n\n* expat: expat: Denial of Service via integer overflow during XML attribute parsing (CVE-2026-118370)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"mingw32-expat","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/mingw32-expat?distro=rocky-linux-8-x86-64&epoch=0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0:2.5.0-7.el8_10"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"PowerTools"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:102193.json"}},{"package":{"name":"mingw32-expat-debuginfo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/mingw32-expat-debuginfo?distro=rocky-linux-8-x86-64&epoch=0